{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ECC","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"傳道書","commonName":"傳道書","title":"傳道書","order":21,"numberOfChapters":12,"sha256":"1813d263c26e831c2567d2bb1a86aceeba0ff4bca2eb75bd8e33b93483b09179","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ECC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":12,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ECC/12.json","totalNumberOfVerses":221},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["萬事均有定時"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"凡事都有定期，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"天下萬務都有定時。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"生有時，死有時；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"栽種有時，拔出所栽種的也有時；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"殺戮有時，醫治有時；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"拆毀有時，建造有時；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"哭有時，笑有時；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"哀慟有時，跳舞有時；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"拋擲石頭有時，堆聚石頭有時；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"懷抱有時，不懷抱有時；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"尋找有時，失落有時；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"保守有時，捨棄有時；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"撕裂有時，縫補有時；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"靜默有時，言語有時；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"喜愛有時，恨惡有時；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"爭戰有時，和好有時。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["這樣看來，做事的人在他的勞碌上有甚麼益處呢？"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["我見上帝叫世人勞苦，使他們在其中受經練。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["上帝造萬物，各按其時成為美好，又將永生",{"noteId":2},"安置在世人心裏。然而上帝從始至終的作為，人不能參透。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["我知道世人，莫強如終身喜樂行善；"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["並且人人吃喝，在他一切勞碌中享福，這也是上帝的恩賜。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["我知道上帝一切所做的都必永存；無所增添，無所減少。上帝這樣行，是要人在他面前存敬畏的心。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["現今的事早先就有了，將來的事早已也有了，並且上帝使已過的事重新再來",{"noteId":3},"。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["世上的不公平"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["我又見日光之下，在審判之處有奸惡，在公義之處也有奸惡。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["我心裏說，上帝必審判義人和惡人；因為在那裏，各樣事務，一切工作，都有定時。"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["我心裏說，這乃為世人的緣故，是上帝要試驗他們，使他們覺得自己不過像獸一樣。"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["因為世人遭遇的，獸也遭遇，所遭遇的都是一樣：這個怎樣死，那個也怎樣死，氣息都是一樣。人不能強於獸，都是虛空。"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["都歸一處，都是出於塵土，也都歸於塵土。"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["誰知道人的靈是往上升，獸的魂是下入地呢？"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["故此，我見人莫強如在他經營的事上喜樂，因為這是他的分。他身後的事誰能使他回來得見呢？"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":2,"caller":"-","text":"原文是永遠","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":11}},{"noteId":3,"caller":"-","text":"或譯：並且上帝再尋回已過的事","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":15}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ECC/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ECC/4.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ECC/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":22}